  "description": "Transport-agnostic .NET diagnostics engine: attaches to a live process over the runtime diagnostic IPC socket and exposes process discovery, EventCounters, CPU/allocation sampling, GC and exception collection, heap and thread snapshots, and dumps. Wraps Microsoft.Diagnostics.NETCore.Client, Microsoft.Diagnostics.Runtime (ClrMD) and TraceEvent behind a use-case API. Shared engine behind the dotnet-diagnostics MCP server and CLI.",
